{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02708",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.01,
      "end_seconds": 2.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "Morning, come on through."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 6.22,
      "end_seconds": 10.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "Ah, hello, thanks for fitting me in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 12.03,
      "end_seconds": 14.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Doctor, thank you for seeing us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.77,
      "end_seconds": 25.05,
      "duration_seconds": 8.28,
      "text": "Alright, yes, that's no problem at all. Please sit. What would you like to start with today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 26.97,
      "end_seconds": 30.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "We came because of poor concentration."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.66,
      "end_seconds": 36.04,
      "duration_seconds": 5.38,
      "text": "So, since when exactly? I'll explain everything as we go along."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.78,
      "end_seconds": 48.47,
      "duration_seconds": 7.69,
      "text": "Probably about four days. Yeah. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.74,
      "end_seconds": 53.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "Would you say mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.57,
      "end_seconds": 56.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "Mild, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.21,
      "end_seconds": 60.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.52,
      "end_seconds": 75.26,
      "duration_seconds": 9.74,
      "text": "Right, when it starts I tend to get tender spots as well. The tender spots? That's been since Monday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.86,
      "end_seconds": 80.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.35,
      "end_seconds": 101.15,
      "duration_seconds": 18.8,
      "text": "I smoke roughly a pack every two days. I only drink at family occasions. I live with my elderly mother. I hardly move around during the day. I work in accounts at a hospital."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.97,
      "end_seconds": 105.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.73,
      "end_seconds": 113.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "I have asthma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.46,
      "end_seconds": 125.63,
      "duration_seconds": 10.17,
      "text": "Right, so asthma is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Is there any regular medication you use?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.15,
      "end_seconds": 130.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "No, nothing at the moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.78,
      "end_seconds": 149.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.88,
      "end_seconds": 154.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "Erm, nothing, I haven't had any operations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.41,
      "end_seconds": 158.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "Did you get weight loss or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.69,
      "end_seconds": 163.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Mm, nope, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.73,
      "end_seconds": 168.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Any joint swelling or rash at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.82,
      "end_seconds": 174.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "Okay, you know, so no, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.51,
      "end_seconds": 178.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.77,
      "end_seconds": 182.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "No problems with breathing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.08,
      "end_seconds": 188.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "Anything with your heart, like skipped beats or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.72,
      "end_seconds": 194.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "My heart's been fine, as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.45,
      "end_seconds": 197.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Let me take your readings now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.0,
      "end_seconds": 210.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.05,
      "end_seconds": 228.44,
      "duration_seconds": 7.39,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 79 beats a minute, BP is 115 over 75, temp 36.9 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 230.33,
      "end_seconds": 232.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.41,
      "end_seconds": 236.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "I'll interpret them after the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.77,
      "end_seconds": 242.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "May I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 259.16,
      "end_seconds": 261.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "Yeah, no problem."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.48,
      "end_seconds": 264.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.4,
      "end_seconds": 277.87,
      "duration_seconds": 5.47,
      "text": "Your joints are not swollen and you are tender over many muscle points."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.7,
      "end_seconds": 283.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "You can sit up now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.37,
      "end_seconds": 329.69,
      "duration_seconds": 29.32,
      "text": "So where does that leave us? The most likely explanation is fibromyalgia. It could also be polymyalgia, so we'll keep that open. I want blood tests done, that's for widespread pain. You'll be taking amitriptyline, 10 milligrams, at night, long term. That's for pain and sleep. The pharmacy will go through the details again when you pick it up. Gentle graded exercise such as swimming helps more than rest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 335.23,
      "end_seconds": 343.24,
      "duration_seconds": 8.01,
      "text": "If the symptoms get worse, that's the point to come in urgently. Let's plan a check in six weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 343.91,
      "end_seconds": 348.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "I'll book it on my way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 349.06,
      "end_seconds": 354.22,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "text": "Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 354.79,
      "end_seconds": 359.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 360.53,
      "end_seconds": 361.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "See you soon."
    }
  ]
}